# ── SECRETS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WRAPCOMMAND_Supa_Secrets.md was committed to this repo with a live Supabase
# service role key, an sb_secret, and a Vercel personal token. It has been
# removed and those credentials rotated. These rules exist so a file like it
# cannot be added back by hand.
#
# `.env` IS intentionally tracked: every var in it is VITE_*, which Vite inlines
# into the browser bundle, so those values are public by construction. Anything
# genuinely secret belongs in .env.local (ignored below) or, for edge functions,
# in the "Set Function Secret" workflow — never in a tracked file.
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env.local

# Ad-hoc credential notes — the exact shape of the file that leaked
*[Ss]ecrets.md
*[Ss]ecret*.txt
credentials.*
*-service-account*.json
vertex-ai-key.json
